@startuml federation_flow_without_localization
title Federation reference flow - Variant B (no localization service, ask-all)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam wrapWidth 260
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
skinparam BoxPadding 10
autonumber

actor "Consumer" as C
participant "openEHR Federation\n(gateway)" as F
participant "PIX Manager\n(per known community)" as P
participant "CDR + Query API\n(per node)" as D

C -> F : AQL, patient by ehr_status/subject = 123
note over F : No localization service - ask all known communities

loop per known community (ask-all)
  F -> P : PIXm $ihe-pix (ITI-83)\nsourceIdentifier=123, targetSystem=ehrId
  P --> F : local ehr_id if it exists, else not-found
end

group per node with a resolved ehr_id
  F -> D : standard AQL  WHERE e/ehr_id/value = <local ehr_id>
  D --> F : rows
end
F --> C : combined result set + meta\n(not-resolved nodes listed)
@enduml
